sequenceDiagram
    participant TestRunner as Test Runner (pytest)
    participant PlayerLLM as Player (LLM)
    participant GMAgent as MONITOR (GMAgent)
    participant CanonKeeper as CanonKeeper
    participant DB as Neo4j / MongoDB

    TestRunner->>PlayerLLM: Start Session (Base Prompt)
    loop For 15 Turns
        PlayerLLM->>GMAgent: Declare Chaotic Action
        GMAgent->>GMAgent: Resolve Intent & Mechanics
        GMAgent->>CanonKeeper: Propose World Changes
        CanonKeeper->>DB: Write Safe Changes
        GMAgent->>PlayerLLM: Return Prose
    end
    TestRunner->>DB: Verify Graph Integrity
